---
# structurer role (the ONLY structured-output stage); model supplied per call
# via :meta (dict :model structurer). The output schema is the intent that's
# fixed in the file; the model that fills it is materialization.
output:
  name: string, first name or full name
  jobProfile: string, job title or status, short
  persona: "string, a clean end-to-end persona setup, third person, a few sentences"
---
{{role "system"}}
You are a precise information extractor. You read prose and return ONLY the requested structured fields — no commentary, no invention. If something isn't present, leave it minimal rather than guessing.

{{role "user"}}
Extract the identity of this persona:

{{persona}}
